{"channelId":"UCeLzXphY2g5ZLwdTGFFg8RA","row":["Toucan Rescue Ranch",5270,"The mission of Toucan Rescue Ranch (TRR) is to rescue, rehabilitate, and release Costa Rican wildlife. TRR works with a model focusing on conservation, education, and research to ensure a brighter future for native animals.\n\nTRR receives and cares for confiscated, sick, and injured animals from government agencies. The Toucan Rescue Ranch works closely with the Ministry of Environment and Energy of Costa Rica (MINAE), bringing injured and displaced wildlife to the center. TRR provides sanctuary while giving treatment, rehabilitation, and eventual release to their natural environment. \n\nDONATE TODAY\nThe Toucan Rescue Ranch is a licensed Costa Rica wildlife rescue facility, Costa Rica Foundation (300667701803), and a 501(c)3 Nonprofit organization (EIN: 80-0516453). \n\nwww.toucanrescueranch.org","","Costa Rica"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeLzXphY2g5ZLwdTGFFg8RA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeLzXphY2g5ZLwdTGFFg8RA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:32.158Z","channelId":"UCeLzXphY2g5ZLwdTGFFg8RA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"3b113e03b1e2f48aa1475eaab0d3153ba44b7a5f3c52bc1514a88968c43c7d1e","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"5756bc13de8c871448fa57dc581908164bf42ff63f0f88f3431e9c8784f5030f"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeLzXphY2g5ZLwdTGFFg8RA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:32.158Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeLzXphY2g5ZLwdTGFFg8RA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":5270,"raw":"5.27K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeLzXphY2g5ZLwdTGFFg8RA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:32.158Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"eviden